  "description": {
   "en": "In a world that finally returned to peace after the Demon King’s defeat, lives Rex, a magical doctor who runs a small clinic specializing in treating strange injuries and bizarre illnesses.\n\nBut instead of living a quiet, simple life, Rex finds himself surrounded by the weirdest and wildest cases imaginable!\n\nEvery patient has a story stranger than the last — odd behaviors, mysterious conditions, and problems you’d only encounter in a fantasy world filled with magical creatures and absurd powers.\n\nAnd while Rex tries his best to treat them seriously and professionally, day after day, he ends up caught in endless hilarious and chaotic situations!\n\nA lighthearted fantasy comedy about a magical doctor…\nand his daily struggle to survive his outlandish patients!"
  },
